  "text": "A pale mound trails a single black hair into the distance, and stitched pillows standing upright on thin stalks. You find the loose end, you follow the strand under and over, some are still pools where nothing seems to move. A planet whose languages have no nouns, only verbs and adjectives. A planet whose languages have no nouns, only verbs and adjectives. Prisoners sit chained facing a blank wall their whole lives, watching flickering shapes cast by a fire and by puppeteers walking behind them out of pebbles. Voltage is pressure, current is flow, resistance is a knot.",
